# 🇪🇹 Habesha Kitchen — ${s.environment} environment

| | |
|---|---|
| Region | `${s.region}` |
| EKS cluster | `${s.cluster.name}` (k8s ${s.cluster.kubernetes_version}) |
| Configure kubectl | `${s.cluster.kubeconfig_command}` |

## Platform services
| Service | URL / Endpoint | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| Jenkins | ${s.jenkins.url} | user `${s.jenkins.admin_user}`; password: `${s.jenkins.password_command}`; job `${s.jenkins.pipeline_job}` |
| JFrog Artifactory | ${s.artifactory.url} | user `${s.artifactory.admin_user}`; password: `${s.artifactory.password_command}` |
| Docker registry | `${s.artifactory.docker_registry}` | repo `docker-local` (created by the pipeline) |
| JFrog Xray | ${s.xray.url} | enabled: ${s.xray.enabled} (needs Xray-capable license) |
| Trivy server | `${s.trivy.server_url_in_cluster}` | in-cluster only |
| Trivy Operator | namespace `${s.trivy.operator_namespace}` | `${s.trivy.reports_command}` |

## Application
- Namespace: `${s.app.namespace}`
- Helm release: `${s.app.helm_release}`
- Get app URL after the pipeline runs: `${s.app.url_command}`

## Deployed chart versions (pin these in tfvars `chart_versions`)
%{ for k, v in s.helm_chart_versions ~}
- ${k}: `${v}`
%{ endfor ~}
